  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Avatar 3.0 allows a great deal of customization but the downside is this is all reset when you change avatars, use a portal, or exit the game.\nPlease save the list of stage parameters for each worn avatar so they can be loaded back when worn again.\n\"Reset Avatar\" would still work to reset them all back their initial settings.\n\nI don't know if this could just be a local appdata save or saved to account but any form of persistence would be nice.",
